Error [jet.PinWithoutWriteWindow]: `pin` needs a named place to pin
  --> tests/ui/pin_needs_write_window.jet:7:21
    |
  7 |     pinned: mem.pin(Node{payload: node.payload})
    |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A pin promises one storage location will not move, so it has to name that location instead of a temporary value
 Fix: Bind the value to a `:=` name, then write `mem.pin(place)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0218
